    "updated_at": "2026-07-27T12:41:45Z",
    "body": "We found the usage of move is [very very low at 0.00003%](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/4564), I think that's an ok level to try renaming it. (I'm not saying we should remove the feature.)\r\n\r\nBlink's telemetry names also say [\"rename\" and \"reparent\"](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/modules/file_system_access/file_system_file_handle.idl;l=43-58?q=FileSystemFileHandle%20file:idl) so the current overloading is unfortunate.",
